Package: swat-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: SWAT desktop wallpaper and branding assets
 Installs the default SWAT desktop wallpaper into the shared
 backgrounds directory, independent of a full ISO respin.
 .
 This package exists to validate the apt packaging pipeline
 (build, sign, publish, install) with a low-risk asset package
 before anything with real behavior is packaged the same way.
